Description:

The vnd.cmu.visibleUsers event parameter now lists the users who can read the
mailbox, and is only sent when event_extra_params asks for it.  It was always
empty before, so it never appeared in events.


Documentation:

None beyond its name in the list of event_extra_params values.


Config changes:

event_extra_params: vnd.cmu.visibleUsers now takes effect.


Upgrade instructions:

Add vnd.cmu.visibleUsers to event_extra_params to receive it on mailbox
events.


GitHub issue:

None.
